      "body": "Fixes #43707\n\n## Motivation\n\n`NanoNemotronVLImageProcessor.__init__` set `Image.MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS = None`. That is process-global Pillow state, so once a NanoNemotron model was loaded, Pillow's decompression-bomb guard was off for every later image decode in the process (including the generic `Image.open(...).load()` path in `utils/common.py`), not just NanoNemotron requests.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Remove the global `Image.MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS = None` assignment. It came in with the original model port (#12277) and nothing in the processor relies on it; Pillow's default limit (warning above ~89M pixels, error above ~179M) is far above the image sizes the processor tiles.\n- Add `test/registered/unit/multimodal/test_nano_nemotron_vl_processor.py` (CPU suite), which constructs the processor with stubbed dependencies and checks `Image.MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS` is unchanged. It fails on `main` (`None != 89478485`) and passes with this change.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable: no change to model outputs or kernels.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39046021741](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39046021741)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39046021640](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39046021640)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39046022002](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39046022002)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
